\item \strong{No disordinal interaction}: Shift functions are parallel (constant vertical separation)
\item \strong{Disordinal interaction}: Shift functions cross or diverge substantially
\item \strong{Ordinal interaction}: Shift functions differ in slope but don't cross
}

